<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  2.54% (Discount)	 C/S =  1.27% (Discount)</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.54% (Discount)	 O/N =  1.27% (Discount)</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.54% (Discount)	 T/N =  1.27% (Discount)</p>
<p>		   Jan  29, 1997			Jan 28, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  3.73%	1 month forward =  2.72%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  5.43%	2 month forward =  4.92%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.79%	3 month forward =  6.22%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.79%	4 month forward =  6.53%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.06%	5 month forward =  6.86%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.20%	6 month forward =  7.03%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
